<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Name pools for the global cast (DATA_MODEL § 18.4). Names are display data, never identity.
    Organizations: wordA + wordB (+ optional suffix), e.g. "Dead Red", "Golden Compass",
    "Lucky Rats", "Horizon Company". People (Solos, Fixers): first "nickname" last.
    Pools are content: other mods may add their own TheNetwork.NamePoolDef with the same kind to
    extend them (entries of every def of a kind are merged).
  -->

